sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Andrecomp
    participant Vault
    participant Supabase
    User->>Andrecomp: Select Supabase method and agent access
    alt Hosted MCP browser sign-in
        Andrecomp->>Supabase: Read protected resource and issuer metadata
        Andrecomp->>Supabase: Register instance OAuth client
        Andrecomp->>User: Open authorization URL
        User->>Supabase: Choose organization and consent
        Supabase->>Andrecomp: Instance callback with authorization code
        Andrecomp->>Supabase: Exchange code with PKCE
    else Personal access token
        User->>Andrecomp: Enter token and optional or required project reference
    end
    Andrecomp->>Vault: Store selected grant credential
    Andrecomp->>Supabase: MCP discovery or native project probe
    User->>Andrecomp: Set action permissions
    Andrecomp->>Andrecomp: Authorize agent run and selected grant
    Andrecomp->>Vault: Resolve selected invocation credential
    Andrecomp->>Supabase: Invoke permitted action
    Andrecomp->>Andrecomp: Record bounded result and audit
